                                "example_id": "591dc662-1167-44d3-9ca3-f5b366037490",
                                "sense_id": "fc85d2e4-54e8-3da1-802f-1c5169ed06fa",
                                "text": "There were owners of lines of schooners, large contributors to the societies, and small men, their few craft pawned to the mastheads, with bankers and marine-insurance agents, captains of tugs and water-boats, riggers, fitters, lumpers, salters, boat-builders, and coopers, and all the mixed population of the water-front."
